# Per-page SEO metadata

Follow `docs/SEO.md`. Use `buildMetadata` from `lib/metadata.ts` with unique `title`, `description`, and `path`.

- Static pages: `export const metadata = buildMetadata({ title, description, path })`
- Dynamic pages (`app/[slug]`, `app/locations/[slug]`): `generateMetadata` that returns `buildMetadata(...)`
- Never export both `metadata` and `generateMetadata` from the same file
- Title pattern: `{Page} | Epsom Cryo Spa Mumbai` (~50–60 chars)
- Description: unique, ~140–160 chars, benefit + Mumbai / location / CTA
- `path` is the public URL with a trailing slash (`/` for home)
- Canonical, Open Graph, and Twitter tags are generated — do not add duplicate meta tags in JSX
